  "reasoning": "The defendants are village officials who used their authority to allocate public land and social insurance benefits to relatives in exchange for cash payments. Accepting money for performing official duties constitutes bribery (受贿). Additionally, they misappropriated public land (a public asset) for private use, which fits the crime of embezzlement of public property (职务侵占). Both crimes apply.",
